{"title":"마도조사 [19세 완전판][단행본]","thumbnail":null,"synopsis":"사문을 배신하고 인간의 길을 포기한 악마, 이릉노조夷陵老祖 위무선.그가 난장강 대토벌전에서 죽자 사람들은 환호한다.이후 오랜 세월 외로이 떠돌던 위무선의 혼백은금지된 주술인 헌사를 통해 다른 이의 육신으로 거듭난다.새로운 몸을 얻은 위무선은 자신의 정체를 숨기려 하나,그를 둘러싼 운명은 천천히 다시 흐르기 시작하는데……새로운 인연과 다시 만난 이들.서서히 드러나는 거대한 음모의 전말.마도조사魔道祖師 위무선의 이야기가 다시 시작된다!","topComments":[],"commentKeywords":[],"rankSeries":{"daily":[{"date":"2026-08-09","rank":102,"change":{"type":"down","amount":62}},{"date":"2026-08-10","rank":58,"change":{"type":"up","amount":44}},{"date":"2026-08-13","rank":155,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-14","rank":79,"change":{"type":"up","amount":76}},{"date":"2026-08-15","rank":67,"change":{"type":"up","amount":12}},{"date":"2026-08-16","rank":107,"change":{"type":"down","amount":40}},{"date":"2026-08-17","rank":158,"change":{"type":"down","amount":51}},{"date":"2026-08-18","rank":190,"change":{"type":"down","amount":32}},{"date":"2026-08-19","rank":117,"change":{"type":"up","amount":73}},{"date":"2026-08-21","rank":290,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-22","rank":252,"change":{"type":"up","amount":38}},{"date":"2026-08-23","rank":75,"change":{"type":"up","amount":177}},{"date":"2026-08-24","rank":77,"change":{"type":"down","amount":2}},{"date":"2026-08-25","rank":139,"change":{"type":"down","amount":62}},{"date":"2026-09-01","rank":114,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-02","rank":116,"change":{"type":"down","amount":2}},{"date":"2026-09-03","rank":124,"change":{"type":"down","amount":8}},{"date":"2026-09-04","rank":174,"change":{"type":"down","amount":50}},{"date":"2026-09-05","rank":179,"change":{"type":"down","amount":5}},{"date":"2026-09-06","rank":153,"change":{"type":"up","amount":26}},{"date":"2026-09-07","rank":48,"change":{"type":"up","amount":105}},{"date":"2026-09-08","rank":58,"change":{"type":"down","amount":10}},{"date":"2026-09-10","rank":180,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-11","rank":150,"change":{"ty